WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:04.055 line:78% align:center
Every line changes a landscape.

2
00:00:12.900 --> 00:00:15.068 line:78% align:center
In the Thar, power lines are now

3
00:00:15.118 --> 00:00:18.626 line:78% align:center
the biggest killer of
the Great Indian Bustard.

4
00:00:20.350 --> 00:00:24.826 line:78% align:center
